{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1327398-games-about-magic","id":1327398,"title":"Games about magic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-25T06:00:55-07:00","id":1327398,"title":"Games about magic","content":"Hi. I've been for a few days in a rather happy reading spree of Mage: The Awakening and Mage: The Ascension. I don't have a clear preference though, and both so far seem a daunting to GM (I will get to it, at some point, I hope.). So I was wondering which other games about mages and magic do you know/like/play/would recommend, specially if they're different to the gnosticism and the consensual reality from these two, for the sake of variety.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25136-kev\u00e4\u00e4n-neito","name":"Kev\u00e4\u00e4n Neito","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25136_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-25T11:23:39-07:00","id":1327472,"title":"","content":"Well there are quite a few I imagine, but here are some that popped into mind:<br /> <b>Ars Magica</b>, the precursor of Mage the Ascension centered on the Order of Hermes.<br /> <br /> <b>CJ Carellas Witchcraft</b> (currently available free from DriveThruRPG) which in it\u2019s core has focus on Pagan witches, rosicrucian Mages, magical cats, psychics, necromancers and the blessed.<br /> <br /> <b>Changeling the Dreaming 20th anniversary edition</b> which is certainly about magic but not so much of Mages.<br /> <br /> Those 3 are some that are quite centered on the theme of Magic though there are, as you are likely aware, plenty of games with magic in them, like almost every Fantasy game out there, but in most of those magic is not on the center stage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-25T19:38:52-07:00","id":1327519,"title":"","content":"Unknown Armies is the game I wish Mage was. Doing magic requires a lot of obsession and arguably a lot of personal damage, presenting their \u2018mages\u2019 as fundamentally broken people doing fascinating stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-12T22:05:07-07:00","id":1387903,"title":"","content":"Magic: The Gathering is an example.<br /> \u200bBest <a href=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/clash-royale-pc/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">card game</span></a> ever. Solid <a href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/homescapes/fjcaoplmimgmpclgpeccabmfjnnhcglk\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">video game</span></a> implementation. Complexity allows for players to be successful due to intelligence, knowledge, and obviously a little luck even though it appears to be a pay to win game. The reality is paying money only allows you to build multiple strong decks faster if you know what you're doing. Wildcards are very nice and underappreciated by the community. Mastery pass is worth the money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26141-johnyjohny","name":"JohnyJohny","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T06:01:06-07:00","id":1388000,"title":"","content":"Shadowrun has all sorts of magic","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T07:45:26-07:00","id":1388045,"title":"","content":"Magicians RPG. Language Learning meets dissatisfaction with the world as expressed through dramatic angst. Honestly, just simply using it as an excuse to learn Korean is enough, but that approach also makes magic more tactile and frustrating than any other take on it I've seen, and both of those are things I really feel are important to the struggle with and joyful experience of magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T04:47:32-07:00","id":1456950,"title":"","content":"Invisible Sun by Monte cook games is all about magic, different types of magic, magic as setting, flavor and system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-16T22:09:26-07:00","id":1457007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1327398-games-about-magic?p=1456950#post1456950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Invisible Sun by Monte cook games is all about magic, different types of magic, magic as setting, flavor and system.</div> </div> </div> </div>I watched a video of him running the game. I couldn't get into it. When I came across a series of Monte Cook running his other game, Numenera, I watched every single video. Although only one of the three classes is specifically magical, the world is full of Cyphers, which are like science-fantasy magic items. It would be comparable to having Wonders in Ascension being so common that you come across them frequently, but the function and operation of most are no longer understood. They have to be figured out, usually by Nanos, the Mage-like class.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-18T16:19:49-08:00","id":1500077,"title":"","content":"Magic: The Gathering this is my favorite by far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27666-pazuri","name":"Pazuri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-19T13:29:37-08:00","id":1500131,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">At first I was tempted to recommend A Witch's Tale, Final Fantasy, LostMagic, but then I read the question again. I'm a fan of </span><a href=\"https://www.retrogamingstores.com/nintendo-ds-games\" target=\"_blank\">DS Games</a><span style=\"color:#000000\"> so that's why I'm thinking of it straight away. I don't know as much about magic board games as I know about video games. I've played Mage Knight about fighting for territory and Sagani about the spirits of the four elements. I play board games with friends really rarely. While I'm not a fan of board games and have played mostly Alias, I really enjoyed Sagani.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27589,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","user":"seylen","date":". 12-21-2022, 11:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27589-seylen","name":"seylen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-21T11:26:03-08:00","id":1500319,"title":"","content":"I do like Mage The Awakening &amp; Changeling The Lost for there types of magic myself and I do have a soft spot for Shadowrun back in the day. But I'm so out of touch with the setting that I don't what has happened in that series anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-21T13:02:24-08:00","id":1500326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1327398-games-about-magic?p=1500319#post1500319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do like Mage The Awakening &amp; Changeling The Lost for there types of magic myself and I do have a soft spot for Shadowrun back in the day. But I'm so out of touch with the setting that I don't what has happened in that series anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/450685-i-m-super-excited-for-the-new-series-of-darkness-rangers#post450685\">Summer developed a drinking problem and Dave took up puppet theatre.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T12:51:56-08:00","id":1500392,"title":"","content":"I don't know if your joking or not ArcaneArts. It would be a shame if it's true as that was the game tat got me interested into urban fantasy settings that led to White-Wolf games later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T13:43:36-08:00","id":1500397,"title":"","content":"Shadowrun is kinda cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T16:51:53-08:00","id":1500408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1327398-games-about-magic?p=1500392#post1500392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know if your joking or not ArcaneArts. It would be a shame if it's true as that was the game tat got me interested into urban fantasy settings that led to White-Wolf games later.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am being highly facetious, and you should pick up Awakening and Lost Second Editions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-23T09:28:05-08:00","id":1500455,"title":"","content":"I love Changeling The Lost greatly and I've been trying to seek out the second editions for that series. I do like Mage The Awakening a fair bit and I'm a fan of The Mysterium &amp; Guardians Of The Veil Orders with Mastigos &amp; Moros as my preferred paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T09:49:58-08:00","id":1500735,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for other games about mages and magic that are different from the gnosticism and consensual reality of Mage: The Awakening and Mage: The Ascension, I recommend checking out the following:<br /> <br /> -Chronicles of Darkness (formerly known as New World of Darkness) - This game system has a number of different settings and rulebooks, including Mage: The Sorcerers Crusade and Mage: The Fallen.<br /> <br /> -The Dresden Files RPG - Based on the popular urban fantasy series by Jim Butcher, this game combines magic and noir detective elements.<br /> <br /> -Ars Magica - This classic game is set in medieval Europe and focuses on the politics and power struggles of a covenant of mages.<br /> <br /> -The Laundry RPG - Based on the Laundry Files novels by Charles Stross, this game combines magic and bureaucracy in a secret government agency.<br /> <br /> -The Secret World - This MMO has a modern setting and a wide variety of different types of magic and supernatural powers.<br /> <br /> All of these games offer a different take on magic and mages than the ones you have been reading about, and can provide a refreshing change of pace for your role-playing game experience.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Are you a dragon enthusiast looking for the perfect accessory to showcase your love for these mythical creatures? Look no further! My <a href=\"https://autumn-dragon.com/collections/dragon-rings\" target=\"_blank\">dragon rings</a> are masterfully crafted with intricate details and a touch of magic.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27757-dreuxmichel","name":"DreuxMichel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T06:24:08-08:00","id":1500931,"title":"","content":"Oh, there are enough good recommendations here. I know a few games, but I also found something new for me. Thanks, guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27694-devamona","name":"devamona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27694_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-02T19:27:34-08:00","id":1501993,"title":"","content":"The Ascension is one of my favorite-games. So, I was reading AD&amp;D2e Player's Handbook a while ago: I've never read the magic-section as I never really liked magic in the game. I was impressed by it; Yes, it's all a bunch of boring spells like a video-game, but the other stuff was interesting like having to spend years mastering the movement and somatics to invoke magical-energy; I could run good magic-user/mage game for Dungeons &amp; Dragons. <br /> <br /> I know this thread is old, but I would suggest just getting a random RPG-book that's a game about magic and go with it; you might like it, or you might not. Believe it or not, but Mekton has a really good magic/psychic-power rules system that rocks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T14:29:57-07:00","id":1510413,"title":"","content":"I recently picked up Star Finder and I find the setting and magic cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-01T15:06:21-07:00","id":1510418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1327398-games-about-magic?p=1510413#post1510413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I recently picked up Star Finder and I find the setting and magic cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love Starfinder. It really isn\u2019t know enough for how good it is. <br /> <br /> One of these days I\u2019ll actually get to play it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-02T12:23:21-07:00","id":1510509,"title":"","content":"There is so many hours in the day or week to try things out and that sucks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 05-02-2023, 03:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-27T10:38:37-07:00","id":1512979,"title":"","content":"Hey there! If you're looking for other games that explore mages and magic, I've got a few recommendations for you to add some variety to your collection. One intriguing option is &quot;Ars Magica,&quot; a role-playing game that delves into medieval fantasy and the Order of Hermes. It offers a unique magic system and a richly detailed world. Another one worth checking out is &quot;Unknown Armies,&quot; which explores modern occultism and focuses on different types of magicians called &quot;Adepts.&quot; The game has a gritty and psychological approach to magic. Lastly, &quot;Shadowrun&quot; blends cyberpunk and fantasy elements, featuring mages alongside hackers and cyber-enhanced operatives in a dystopian world. Each of these games brings its own flavor and spin on the mage genre, offering fresh perspectives and new avenues for magical storytelling. Happy gaming!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27939-dazert1","name":"Dazert1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27939_1.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-27T11:55:21-07:00","id":1512989,"title":"","content":"I was a fan of Shadow